  "prototypeNotes": [
    "Invalidations record inconsistent dependent state; they are not generic validation errors.",
    "An upstream change may create an invalidation instead of silently replacing a user selection.",
    "Warnings may require acknowledgement, but acknowledgement never resolves an invalidation.",
    "Open blocking or error invalidations prevent Character completion.",
    "Resolved and superseded items remain part of the audit history.",
    "Chronicle owns persistence, encryption, fingerprints, transactionality, and events.",
    "The Rule Set owns trigger conditions, severity, allowed resolutions, and proof of resolution."
  ]
